# Hyphen glue

A per-turn opt-in in both versions is one word followed by another.

The flag is in in-memory mode, which is not a doubling either.

The record is next-keyed
keyed by the tail of that identifier, which this scan refuses.

Ordinary prose, where the the doubling must be reported.
